function preTypeStartAttack(charge=0){p.attackBatch=++fxSerial;withAttackRole('basic',preJourneyStartAttack,[charge],p.attackBatch);if(run.evolution>=2&&p.isFinisher){if(['aren','blade'].includes(run.mask)){if(run.mask==='blade'||p.ascendCounter>0){p.vx+=p.dir*100;grantShield(5,1);p.inv=Math.max(p.inv,.25);p.ascendCounter=0;}}if(run.mask==='storm')for(const s of shots.filter(s=>s.owner==='storm'&&s.basic))s.pierce=Math.max(s.pierce,2);}}
function preTypeResolveBasic(dt){withAttackRole('basic',preJourneyResolveBasic,[dt],p.attackBatch);}
function preTypeCastSkill(slot,swap=false){if(p['skill'+slot+'CD']>0&&!swap)return;const empowered=run.mask==='nox'&&p.noxStars>=3,castBatch=++fxSerial;withAttackRole('skill'+slot,preJourneyCastSkill,[slot,swap],castBatch);registerSkillVisual(run.mask,'skill'+slot,castBatch);if(run.evolution>=2&&p['skill'+slot+'CD']>0){const s=maskState();if(run.mask==='beast'&&slot===2&&!s.allies.some(a=>a.kind==='owl'))ally('owl',p.x+15,{orbit:true,power:1.4,life:12});if(run.mask==='engineer'){for(const a of s.allies)if(a.kind==='turret')a.static=false;if(slot===2)grantShield(12,4);}if(run.mask==='chrono'&&slot===2)addZone('frostfield',p.x+15,playerCombatFloor(),190,0,{duration:3,role:'skill2',owner:'chrono'});if(run.mask==='puppet'&&slot===2)for(const e of s.links)e.armourBreak=3;if(run.mask==='warden'||run.mask==='nox'&&empowered)grantShield(12,2);if(run.mask==='tide'&&slot===2)p.ascendSplash=true;}}
function preTypeCastUltimate(){if(p.energy<100)return;const castBatch=++fxSerial;withAttackRole('ultimate',preJourneyCastUltimate,[],castBatch);if(run.mask!=='ember')registerSkillVisual(run.mask,'ultimate',castBatch);if(run.evolution>=2&&run.mask==='necro'){const s=maskState();s.allies=s.allies.filter(a=>a.kind!=='bone');ally('deathKnight',p.x+60,{power:2.5,life:15});}}
function preTypeParrySuccess(x){preJourneyParrySuccess(x);if(run.evolution>=2&&run.mask==='aren'){p.counter=1;p.ascendCounter=3;grantShield(10,3);}}
function preTypeHitEnemy(e,amount,dir=1,parried=false,kind='sword'){const alive=!e.dead,frozen=e.freeze>0,marked=e.mark>0;preJourneyHitEnemy(e,amount,dir,parried,kind);if(run.evolution>=2){if(run.mask==='frost'&&frozen&&['sword','finisher'].includes(kind)&&p.attackCharge>.85&&!(p.ascendedIceCD>0)){p.ascendedIceCD=2;withAttackRole('basic',()=>areaHit(e.x+e.w/2,e.y+e.h/2,140,damage()*.75,'ice','proc'));}if(run.mask==='reaper'&&alive&&e.dead&&marked&&(p.ascendedReaperHeals||0)<6){p.ascendedReaperHeals=(p.ascendedReaperHeals||0)+1;heal(1);}}}
function ascensionTick(dt){const s=maskState();if(run.mask==='rider'){const old=s.wasNitro||0,now=s.nitro||0;if(old>0&&now<=0)withAttackRole('skill1',()=>maskEvent(.08,p.x+15,p.y+24,180,1.6,'wheel'));s.wasNitro=now;}if(run.mask==='tide'&&p.ascendSplash&&p.ground){p.ascendSplash=false;withAttackRole('skill2',()=>maskEvent(.05,p.x+15,playerCombatFloor()-30,230,1.8,'tide'));}if(run.mask==='storm')for(const shot of shots)if(!shot.friendly&&[...s.allies,...summons.filter(a=>a.kind==='totem')].some(a=>Math.abs(a.x-shot.x)<180))shot.vx*=Math.pow(.7,dt);if(run.mask==='mirror'&&p.dash>0&&!(s.mirrorDashCD>0)){s.mirrorDashCD=3;ally('mirror',p.x+15,{static:true,life:3});}s.mirrorDashCD=Math.max(0,(s.mirrorDashCD||0)-dt);}

function rarityBadge(r,mask=false){return `<span class="rarity-label rarity-${r}">${['Ⅰ 일반','Ⅱ 희귀','Ⅲ 영웅','Ⅳ 전설'][r]||'일반'}${mask?' 가면':''}</span>`;}
function bagSlots(){return Array.from({length:BAG_CAPACITY},(_,i)=>{const a=run.inventory[i],h=a&&ITEMS[a.id];return a?`<button class="satchel-cell rarity-${h.rarity} ${selectedBagUID===a.uid?'selected':''}" data-inspect="${a.uid}" title="${h.name} · ${RARITY[h.rarity][0]}">${itemImage(a.id)}<b>${['Ⅰ','Ⅱ','Ⅲ','Ⅳ'][h.rarity]}</b>${Object.values(run.equipment).includes(a.uid)?'<i>착용</i>':''}</button>`:`<div class="satchel-cell empty"><span>${i+1}</span></div>`;}).join('');}
function preTypeRenderSatchel(){if(!run.inventory.some(a=>a.uid===selectedBagUID))selectedBagUID=run.inventory[0]?.uid||null;const a=run.inventory.find(a=>a.uid===selectedBagUID),h=a&&ITEMS[a.id],worn=a&&Object.entries(run.equipment).find(([k,v])=>v===a.uid),safe=equipmentSafe(),stats=sagaStats(),slots=h?(h.slot==='ring'?['ring1','ring2']:h.slot==='aux'?['aux1','aux2','aux3']:[h.slot]):[],current=h&&run.inventory.find(a=>a.uid===run.equipment[slots[0]]),compare=current&&ITEMS[current.id],tags=Object.entries(SYNERGIES).filter(([id])=>(stats.tags[id]||0)>0);$('ledger-content').innerHTML=`<div class="satchel-top"><div><span class="small">TRAVELER'S SATCHEL</span><h2>여행자의 가방 <small>${run.inventory.length} / ${BAG_CAPACITY}</small></h2></div><div class="wallet">● ${run.coins} G <span>◆ ${run.gems||0} 보석</span></div></div><div class="satchel-layout"><aside class="worn-column"><h3>착용 중</h3><div class="worn-slots">${Object.entries(SLOT_NAMES).map(([slot,name])=>{const it=run.inventory.find(a=>a.uid===run.equipment[slot]);return `<button data-inspect="${it?.uid||0}" class="worn-tile rarity-${it?ITEMS[it.id].rarity:0}">${it?itemImage(it.id):'<span>◇</span>'}<small>${name}</small></button>`;}).join('')}</div><div class="build-tags">${tags.map(([id,t])=>`<span class="${stats.tags[id]>=3?'active':''}" title="${t.desc}">${t.name} ${stats.tags[id]}/3·5</span>`).join('')||'시너지는 같은 태그 3개·5개에서 열립니다.'}</div><p>체력 ${Math.ceil(p.hp)}/${stats.hp}<br>물리 ${stats.physicalPower} · 마법 ${stats.magicalPower}<br>이동 ${stats.move}</p></aside><div class="satchel-center"><div class="satchel-grid">${bagSlots()}</div><p class="satchel-note">${safe?'빈 칸을 남겨 두면 새 발견을 가져갈 수 있습니다.':'전투 중에는 살펴볼 수 있습니다. 구역 확보 후 착용·분해하세요.'}</p>${run.overflow?.length?`<details class="legacy-storage"><summary>이전 버전 보관함 · ${run.overflow.length}개</summary><p>기존 저장의 초과 장비를 보존한 보관함입니다. 가방에 빈 칸이 있을 때 가져옵니다.</p>${run.overflow.map(a=>`<button data-retrieve="${a.uid}" ${!safe||run.inventory.length>=BAG_CAPACITY?'disabled':''}>${ITEMS[a.id].name} 가져오기</button>`).join('')}</details>`:''}</div><article class="satchel-detail rarity-${h?.rarity||0}">${h?`${rarityBadge(h.rarity)}<div class="detail-model">${itemImage(a.id)}</div><h3>${h.name}</h3><p>${h.desc}</p>${compare&&compare!==h?`<p class="comparison">현재 ${compare.name} 대비<br>위력 ${(h.power||0)-(compare.power||0)>=0?'+':''}${(h.power||0)-(compare.power||0)} · 체력 ${(h.hp||0)-(compare.hp||0)>=0?'+':''}${(h.hp||0)-(compare.hp||0)}</p>`:''}<div class="detail-tags">${(h.tags||[]).map(id=>`<span>${SYNERGIES[id]?.name||{explorer:'탐험',arcane:'비전',air:'공중',combo:'연격',heavy:'강타'}[id]||id}</span>`).join('')}</div><div class="detail-actions">${worn?`<button data-unequip="${worn[0]}" ${safe?'':'disabled'}>착용 해제</button>`:slots.map(slot=>`<button data-equip="${a.uid}" data-slot="${slot}" ${safe?'':'disabled'}>${SLOT_NAMES[slot]} 착용</button>`).join('')}<button class="dismantle" data-dismantle="${a.uid}" ${!safe||worn||h.bound?'disabled':''}>분해 · ◆ ${gemValue(a.id)}</button>${level.shop?`<button data-sell="${a.uid}" ${!safe||worn||h.bound?'disabled':''}>판매 · ${Math.floor(h.price*.35)} G</button>`:''}</div>${h.bound?'<p>이야기에 남는 유산 · 분해 불가</p>':''}`:'<h3>여행의 빈자리</h3><p>장비를 고르면 여기서 그림과 효과를 살펴볼 수 있습니다.</p>'}</article></div>`;}
function relicStrip(){return '<div class="mask-pair">'+[0,1].map(i=>{const id=run.artifacts[i],r=id?maskRarity(id):0;return `<div class="mask-slot rarity-${r} ${id===run.mask?'active':''}"><small>가면 ${i+1}${id===run.mask?' · 사용 중':''}</small>${id?itemImage('mask:'+id):'<span>◇</span>'}<strong>${id?FORMS[id].name:'빈 가면 칸'}</strong>${id?rarityBadge(r,true)+damageTypeTag(maskDamageProfile(id)==='혼합형'?'mixed':maskDamageType(id),'형'):''}<p>${id?(run.formEvolution[id]||0)+1+'단계 / 3단계':''}</p>${id&&id!=='aren'?`<button data-shatter="${i}" ${!equipmentSafe()||run.artifacts.length<2?'disabled':''}>부수기 · ◆ ${gemValue(id,true,run.formEvolution[id]||0)}</button>`:''}</div>`;}).join('')+'</div>';}
function preTypeMaskDescription(){const id=run.mask,h=FORMS[id],n=maskTier(),f=headFrame(id);return relicStrip()+`<div class="mask-evolution"><div class="evolution-portrait"><img src="${f?.url||f?.image?.toDataURL()||''}" alt="${h.name}"></div><div>${rarityBadge(maskRarity(id),true)}<h2>${evolutionName()}</h2><div class="evolution-steps">${[1,2,3].map(i=>`<span class="${i<=n?'lit':''}">${i}단계</span>`).join('')}</div><p>${h.passive}</p><p>이동 ${h.move} · 기본 체력 ${h.hp}</p><div class="evolution-note">${n===1?`다음 진화 · ◆ ${evolutionCost()} 보석<br>${EVOLUTIONS[id].basic}`:n===2?`최종 진화 · ◆ ${evolutionCost()} 보석<br>${ASCENSIONS[id][1]}`:'최종 단계 · '+ASCENSIONS[id][1]}<br><small>진화 장인 앞에서 V · 보석은 장비·가면 분해와 구출로 얻습니다.</small></div></div></div><div class="skill-notes"><p><b>Z · 기본 공격</b>${h.desc}</p><p><b>A · ${h.s1}</b>${n>1?EVOLUTIONS[id].s1:'가면 고유의 첫 번째 기술'}</p><p><b>S · ${h.s2}</b>${n>1?EVOLUTIONS[id].s2:'가면 고유의 두 번째 기술'}</p><p><b>D · ${h.ultimate||'스킬 3'}</b>${n>1?EVOLUTIONS[id].ultimate:'긴 쿨타임을 사용하는 고유 기술 · 에너지 소모 없음'}</p></div>`;}
function renderLedger(){$('loadout').classList.toggle('chronicle-mode',ledgerTab==='journal');$('loadout').classList.toggle('satchel-mode',ledgerTab==='bag');document.querySelectorAll('[data-journey-tab]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.journeyTab===ledgerTab));if(ledgerTab==='journal'){renderJournal();return;}if(ledgerTab==='bag'){renderSatchel();return;}if(ledgerTab==='mask'){$('ledger-content').innerHTML=`<div class="wallet">● ${run.coins} G <span>◆ ${run.gems||0} 보석</span></div>`+maskDescription();return;}preJourneyRenderLedger();}
function journalEntries(){const s=ensureStory();if(journalSection==='masks')return Object.entries(RELIC_HISTORY).map(([id,[owner,text]])=>{const found=(run.seenMasks||[]).includes(id)||run.artifacts.includes(id);return{title:found?FORMS[id].name:'봉인된 얼굴',subtitle:found?owner:'아직 만나지 못한 영웅',text:found?text:'힘을 만나면, 그 힘이 남긴 사람의 이야기도 이 페이지에 기록된다.',art:found?'mask:'+id:'utility:notebook',seal:found?RARITY[maskRarity(id)][0]+' 가면':'미발견',found};});if(journalSection==='choices')return Object.entries(s.choices).map(([stage,c])=>({title:STAGES[stage-1].name,subtitle:'여정의 '+stage+'번째 길',text:c.label+'\n\n'+choiceConsequence(c.kind),art:'utility:notebook',seal:'당신의 판단',found:true}));if(journalSection==='notebook')return[{title:'루네의 마지막 문장',subtitle:'수첩과 별자리',text:s.flags.notebookDecoded?'나무를 죽이지 않고, 빛을 독점하는 왕좌를 끊을 수 있다. 검과 검집은 서로를 제한한다.':'대전쟁·암살·나무의 주기에 관한 기록과 루네의 수첩이 모이면 마지막 문장을 해독할 수 있다.',art:'utility:notebook',seal:s.flags.notebookDecoded?'해독 완료':'미해독',found:true,notebook:true}];return Object.values(HISTORICAL_RECORDS).map(d=>({title:s.clues.includes(d.id)?d.name:'지워진 문장',subtitle:'역사가 남긴 흔적',text:s.clues.includes(d.id)?d.text:'아직 이 페이지는 비어 있다. 낡은 표식 앞에서 V로 기록을 조사하면, 지워진 사람들의 이름을 찾을 수 있다.',art:'utility:notebook',seal:s.clues.includes(d.id)?'기록을 찾음':'미발견',found:s.clues.includes(d.id)}));}
function renderJournal(){const s=ensureStory(),entries=journalEntries();if(!entries.length)entries.push({title:'아직 쓰이지 않은 길',subtitle:'여정의 시작',text:'어떤 영웅의 유산도 다음 사람의 판단까지 대신할 수 없다.',art:'utility:notebook',seal:'첫 장',found:true});journalPage=clamp(journalPage,0,entries.length-1);const a=entries[journalPage],canDecode=!s.flags.notebookDecoded&&s.keys.includes('notebook')&&['treaty','assassination','cycle'].every(k=>s.clues.includes(k));$('ledger-content').innerHTML=`<div class="book-shell"><img class="book-background" src="${chronicleImage.src}" alt="펼쳐진 낡은 역사책"><nav class="bookmarks">${[['records','역사'],['masks','가면의 기억'],['choices','여정'],['notebook','루네의 수첩']].map(([id,name])=>`<button data-book-section="${id}" class="${journalSection===id?'active':''}">${name}</button>`).join('')}</nav><div class="book-leaves"><section class="book-page book-left"><span class="book-kicker">${a.subtitle}</span><h2>${a.title}</h2><div class="book-illustration ${a.found?'':'unfound'}">${itemImage(a.art)}</div><div class="book-seal">${a.seal}</div><small>CHAPTER ${journeyPlace().chapter}<br>${journeyPlace().name}</small></section><section class="book-page book-right"><span class="book-kicker">태양의 그늘 · 남겨진 이야기</span><p>${a.text.replaceAll('\n','<br>')}</p>${a.notebook?`<div class="notebook-annotation"><p>발견한 핵심 기록 ${['treaty','assassination','cycle','legacyLink'].filter(k=>s.clues.includes(k)).length} / 4<br>민간인을 지킨 판단 ${s.civic} / 3<br>빛 ${s.alignment} · 어둠 ${100-s.alignment}<br>검집 ${s.keys.includes('scabbard')?'보유':'미발견'} · 서광 ${s.keys.includes('eternalDawn')?'보유':'미발견'}</p><button data-decode ${canDecode?'':'disabled'}>${s.flags.notebookDecoded?'해독 완료':'별자리 해독'}</button><p>${moonEligible()?'달빛의 길이 열릴 수 있다.':'아직 기록되지 않은 조건이 남아 있다.'}</p></div>`:''}<span class="handwritten-note">진실은 언제나 다음 페이지를 남긴다.</span></section></div><footer class="book-pagination"><button data-book-turn="-1" ${journalPage===0?'disabled':''}>← 이전 장</button><span>${journalPage+1} / ${entries.length}</span><button data-book-turn="1" ${journalPage===entries.length-1?'disabled':''}>다음 장 →</button></footer></div>`;}
function drawEconomyWorld(){const treasures=level.treasures,loot=level.loot;level.treasures=[];level.loot=[];preJourneyDrawEconomyWorld();level.treasures=treasures;level.loot=loot;ctx.save();for(const c of treasures){if(c.x<camera.x-90||c.x>camera.x+W+90)continue;const key='journey:chest'+(c.kind==='common'?'Common':c.kind==='rare'?'Rare':'Hero')+(c.opened?'Open':'');drawItemModel(key,c.x+21,c.y+18,c.kind==='hero'?76:64,chestReady(c)?1:.6);if(!c.opened){ctx.font='700 10px WildrootUI';ctx.fillStyle=RARITY[c.rarity][1];ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.fillText(c.kind==='common'?'일반 · 골드':c.kind==='rare'?'희귀 상자':'영웅 · 가면',c.x+21,c.y-17);if(!chestReady(c)){line(c.x+2,c.y+8,c.x+40,c.y+26,'#6c7566',4);line(c.x+40,c.y+8,c.x+2,c.y+26,'#6c7566',4);}}}for(const a of loot){if(a.got||Math.abs(a.x-camera.x-W/2)>W/2+100)continue;const r=ITEMS[a.id].rarity,y=a.y+Math.sin(visualTime*2+a.x)*3;drawLootAura(Math.min(2,r),a.x,y,Math.min(1,(a.rise||1)),.55);drawItemModel(a.id,a.x,y,[45,57,69,74][r]);ctx.font='700 10px WildrootUI';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.fillStyle=RARITY[r][1];ctx.fillText(RARITY[r][0]+' · '+ITEMS[a.id].name,a.x,y-48);}for(const a of level.products||[])if(a.offer.kind==='evolution'){const h=productInfo(a);rr(a.x-49,FLOOR-35,98,23,1,'#253c2b','#8db9b3');ctx.font='700 13px WildrootUI';ctx.fillStyle=(run.gems||0)<h.price?'#b6a496':'#9ee0d7';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.fillText(h.sold?'최종 진화':'◆ '+h.price,a.x,FLOOR-19);}ctx.restore();}
function drawWorldRewards(){const c=level.chest;level.chest=null;preJourneyDrawWorldRewards();level.chest=c;if(c){if(!c.fromTreasure)drawItemModel(c.opened?'journey:chestHeroOpen':'journey:chestHero',c.x+23,c.y+18,72);if(c.opened&&!c.claimed){const r=maskRarity(c.artifact),y=c.y-48+(1-(c.rise??1))*30+Math.sin(visualTime*2)*4;drawLootAura(r,c.x+23,y,1,.7);drawItemModel('mask:'+c.artifact,c.x+23,y,[59,70,82][r]);}}}
function drawJourneyNPCs(){ctx.save();for(const n of level.npcs||[])if(n.rescue&&(n.sector??0)<=level.activeSector){const y=n.y||FLOOR;if(n.x<camera.x-70||n.x>camera.x+W+70)continue;drawItemModel(['journey:villager','journey:scout','journey:artisan'][n.rescueKind],n.x,y-39,82);if(!n.rescued){for(let i=-1;i<=1;i++)line(n.x+i*20,y-89,n.x+i*20,y-4,'#856846',3);line(n.x-25,y-89,n.x+25,y-89,'#a38b58',5);}ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.font='700 11px WildrootUI';ctx.fillStyle=n.rescued?'#c4e3bd':'#ebce92';ctx.fillText(n.rescued?'구출됨':n.speaker,n.x,y-105);if(level.focusNPC===n&&!n.rescued)ctx.fillText('V · 구출',n.x,y-125);}ctx.restore();}
function preRecastDrawRewardTooltip(focus){if(level.focusLoot){const a=level.focusLoot,h=ITEMS[a.id];drawModelTooltip({name:h.name,key:a.id,rarity:h.rarity,kind:'발견한 장비',desc:h.desc},a.x,clamp(a.y-270,185,360),`V 획득 · 가방 ${run.inventory.length}/${BAG_CAPACITY} · G 2초 분해 ◆${gemValue(a.id)}`);return;}if(focus?.kind==='artifact'){const c=focus.value,h=FORMS[c.artifact],hold=p.pickupHold?.source===c?p.pickupHold:null;drawModelTooltip({name:h.name,key:'mask:'+c.artifact,rarity:maskRarity(c.artifact),kind:'변신 가면',desc:maskTypeSummary(c.artifact)+' · '+h.passive},focus.x,clamp(c.y-285,150,340),c.opened?`V 2초 획득 · ${pickupSlot()+1}번 칸 · G 2초 분해 ◆${gemValue(c.artifact,true)}`:'Z 공격 / V · 상자 열기',hold);return;}if(level.focusTreasure){const c=level.focusTreasure;ctx.save();ctx.font='700 12px WildrootUI';ctx.fillStyle='#f0deaa';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.fillText(chestReady(c)?'Z 공격 / V · 상자 열기':'주변의 수호 적을 처치하세요',c.x+21,c.y-42);ctx.restore();return;}if(level.focusProduct){const a=level.focusProduct,h=productInfo(a),money=h.currency==='gems'?run.gems||0:run.coins,unit=h.currency==='gems'?'보석':'G',hold=p.pickupHold?.source===a?p.pickupHold:null,action=h.sold?'완료':money<h.price?(h.currency==='gems'?'보석':'골드')+' 부족':a.offer.kind==='mask'?`V 2초 · ${h.price} ${unit}`:`V ${a.offer.kind==='evolution'?'진화':'구매'} · ${h.price} ${unit}`;drawModelTooltip(h,a.x,FLOOR-365,action,hold);}}
